{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-25","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平行六面体与平面与平行线","englishTitle":"If a parallelepipedal solid be cut by a plane which is parallel to the opposite planes, then, as the base is to the base, so will the solid be to the solid.","book":11,"number":25,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.25","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.25/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":25,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","contentId":"euclid-11-25","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5acd6192e0a09df385313773429c44eebfb465378c74b56c9fa01c09efa9cce","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-25.statement","euclid-11-25.construction.1","euclid-11-25.construction.2","euclid-11-25.proof.1","euclid-11-25.proof.2","euclid-11-25.proof.3","euclid-11-25.proof.4","euclid-11-25.proof.5","euclid-11-25.proof.6","euclid-11-25.proof.7","euclid-11-25.proof.8","euclid-11-25.proof.9","euclid-11-25.conclusion","euclid-11-25.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-25.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5320149352f45c0fb82f52a15f4be7fe581065d2365106410b49b7f52eedd385","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a parallelepipedal solid be cut by a plane which is parallel to the opposite planes, then, as the base is to the base, so will the solid be to the solid."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果平行管道固体被平面的截断,与平面的截断平行,那么,底边的截断线与底边的截断线平行,固体也是固态的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"49198fd0a848570d0470612f393d2dd851e74d9831760997947a6fd73f80066b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the parallelepipedal solid ABCD be cut by the plane FG which is parallel to the opposite planes RA, DH; I say that, as the base AEFV is to the base EHCF, so is the solid ABFU to the solid EGCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将平行管道固体ABCD除以平面 FG,与对的平面 RA,DH;我说,底边 AEFV与底边 EHCF的比等于固体ABFU与固体EGCD的比"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea91953fc8c8c82cc12e4bd4836901a9b73c37c5e94a51e0cc0e1260b6578ebe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AH be produced in each direction, let any number of straight lines whatever, AK, KL, be made equal to AE, and any number whatever, HM, MN, equal to EH; and let the parallelograms LP, KV, HW, MS and the solids LQ, KR, DM, MT be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AH线延伸至每个方向,使任何直线(无论多少),AK,KL,等于AE,而任何直线(不论多少),HM,MN,等于EH;完成平行四边形 LP,KV,HW,MS和LQ,KR,DM,MT。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"906abb2ef96ca50bd88a8f585c9bfe18bbeb9e5c3f6f27588bdf51cf710d1944","citations":["euclid-11-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the straight lines LK, KA, AE are equal to one another, the parallelograms LP, KV, AF are also equal to one another, KO, KB, AG are equal to one another, and further LX, KQ, AR are equal to one another, for they are opposite. [[XI. 24](/principles/euclid-11-24)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,由于LK直线、KA直线、AE直线等同,平行四边形 LP、KV、AF等同,KO、KB、AG等同,还有LX、KQ和AR等同,因为它们是相反的。 [[XI. 24](/principles/euclid-11-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"76424394d2fd82b56b021520e70b4b92f76f5bc656f3be7d199e26bd8ade1a17","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the parallelograms EC, HW, MS are also equal to one another, HG, HI, IN are equal to one another, and further DH, MY, NT are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,平行四边形 EC,HW,MS也彼此平等,HG,HI,IN彼此平等,还有DH,MY,NT彼此平等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"736db1f6362d8c4a263601b65088d2d3dca14e1e4097686dc3942c21e4c665dc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the solids LQ, KR, AU three planes are equal to three planes."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在LQ、KR、AU、3,平面固体中,等于3,平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b524a4a61fcb730d3d911964f9569a8e882417dfeb1a0d30d87766eff97a65d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the three planes are equal to the three opposite; therefore the three solids LQ, KR, AU are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,3,平面等于3,3,LQ,KR,AU等量的固体是相互的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"007f13caf6d193e3f580820605b5dfeec015eebf6130275b700befc580ae4a0a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the three solids ED, DM, MT are also equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,三块ED、DM、MT固体也彼此相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5b724134969d7059bffd4bc4ad020bbe098ca34d80823ba6b421021dc1452a7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, whatever multiple the base LF is of the base AF, the same multiple also is the solid LU of the solid AU."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,无论底边 LF是底边 AF的乘数,AU固体的乘数也是LU。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"880d8265659845e0bfde7f589cf9a75a4a6a66c60b9b3921a085ba1b98cb3c75","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason, whatever multiple the base NF is of the base FH, the same multiple also is the solid NU of the solid HU."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,无论底边 NF是底边 FH的乘数,同一乘数也是HU固体的NU。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35fc8d25d94e737dc376b02f24b45186dd9920200e35ddfad862e6efc86da008","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if the base LF is equal to the base NF, the solid LU is also equal to the solid NU; if the base LF exceeds the base NF, the solid LU also exceeds the solid NU; and, if one falls short, the other falls short."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果底边 LF等于底边 NF,则LU固体也等于NU固体;如果底边 LF超过底边 NF,则LU固体也超过NU;如果一个不足,则另一个不足。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba4f3e056ac4a758286c2d35b86e612c0c4cb1450887ba96e1ab0a628cba8bc3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, there being four magnitudes, the two bases AF, FH, and the two solids AU, UH, equimultiples have been taken of the base AF and the solid AU, namely the base LF and the solid LU, and equimultiples of the base HF and the solid HU, namely the base NF and the solid NU, and it has been proved that, if the base LF exceeds the base FN, the solid LU also exceeds the solid NU, if the bases are equal, the solids are equal, and if the base falls short, the solid falls short."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,有4个等量,即2 底边 AF,FH和2 FH,UH,同倍数两个固体,即底边 AF和AU,底边 LF和LU,底边 HF和HU,同倍数;底边 NF和NU,已经证明,如果底边 LF超过底边 FN,LU固体也超过NU,底边等于,底边的固体是等量,并且,并且,如果固体是等量,则LU也超过NU。如果底边差, 固体就差。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94aca49df69f3d63d896d56e77dc21c2eae7ab11f5a1c2d0789739609b7276f3","citations":["euclid-5-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the base AF is to the base FH, so is the solid AU to the solid UH. [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,底边 AF对底边 FH的比等于AU对UH。 证毕。 [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-25.source","contentId":"euclid-11-25","revisionId":"euclid-11-25@raw-f5acd6192e0a09df","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cfc677fb844729018b69faf87aa4a79aa7891d38d27b8b975cd9e39ec5663d00","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.25/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.25\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-25:euclid-11-24:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-25.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-24","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.25","sourceUrl":"https://